# Greek Alphabet | IPA Symbols Rules
# [AUTHOR]: Carlos González Sanz
#
# > The purpose of this file is to store default
# > Compose rules for typing phonetic symbols
# > mainly found in the IPA chart (including some
# > symbols from extIPA, UPA, etc.)
# > through alphabetical means.
